From 273715fe366305009231d4018adc44b1f6f5c14e Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Christoph Schmidt-Hieber <christoph.schmidthieber@googlemail.com>
Date: Mon, 12 Oct 2026 14:49:35 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] [b4c][msvc] enable Visual Studio 2022 builds

Refresh the downstream MSVC compatibility patch for BioSig 4.0.0, including Medilog, UTF-8 validation, and libiconv channel-label decoding.

Require Visual Studio 2022 17.9 or newer and enable C23 typeof for C
sources, preserving upstream declarations and allocation casts. Use
decltype for the corresponding C++ casts.
